@startuml 20_seq_agent_report
title HTTPS report with active credential only
actor "Paired agent" as Agent
participant "FastAPI /agent/reports" as API
database "Private PostgreSQL" as DB
Agent -> API : POST report + locally held bearer token
API -> DB : Match SHA-256 credential hash\nAND host lifecycle=ACTIVE
DB --> API : authorized host ID or none
alt no valid active credential
 API --> Agent : 401 Unauthorized
else ACTIVE host
 API -> API : Validate bounded payload
 API -> DB : Transaction: sample + process snapshot\n+ server-received heartbeat
 DB --> API : committed received_at
 API --> Agent : 202 Accepted + host_id
end
note right of DB
 Invalid/revoked token never inserts a sample
 or refreshes a heartbeat.
end note
@enduml
